docs {
  # Admin User Environment Access Tests
  
  Tests for granting, revoking, and listing environment access for admin users.
  
  ## Endpoints Tested
  
  - POST /{domainId}/{solutionId}/admin-users/{userId}/environments — grant access
  - DELETE /{domainId}/{solutionId}/admin-users/{userId}/environments/{environmentId} — revoke access
  - GET /{domainId}/{solutionId}/admin-users/{userId}/environments — list user's environments
  
  ## Prerequisites
  
  - An admin user must exist (createdAdminUserId)
  - An environment must exist (createdEnvironmentId)
  - Admin HMAC credentials for authentication
  
  ## What These Tests Cover
  
  - Grant environment access (success)
  - Grant access with domain+solution mismatch (400)
  - Grant duplicate access (409)
  - Revoke environment access (204)
  - List user's environments (200)
}
